V4-duty-scope-with-permission-review; MAINTENANCE-V4-health-diagnostic-scope; PERMISSION-SOVEREIGN-V5-only-for-permission/integrity-investigation+no-content-ownership; 星澄-V4-global-read-only-review-exception+permission-review-exempt+official-information-entry+identity+purpose+scope+redaction+session+audit mandatory; 星澄-VC follows-B100-authoritative-and-Chinese-rules; V5-SECRETS:private-keys+raw-credentials+tokens+passwords+unencrypted-personal-secret-content remain-non-viewable+usable-only-by-dedicated-owner-operation-through-opaque-handle; CROSS-OWNER:requires-explicit-grant+purpose+expiry+owner-scope; DOWNGRADE:automatic-on-expiry+session-change+role-change+incident+connection-generation-change; REVOKE:permission-sovereign immediate+information-layer invalidates-session/cache/subscription; SUBSCRIPTION:each-event revalidated-against-current-grant+field-policy; CACHE:keyed-by-grant-id+scope+field-policy+generation+expiry+invalidated-on-revoke/classification-change; DENIAL:typed-generic-response+redacted-server-diagnostic+audit; AUDIT:requester+actor+level+scope+purpose+fields-category+decision+grant-id+time+correlation-id without-protected-content; REVIEW:periodic+on-role/scope/classification-change; DEFAULT:no-grant=>V0\nFORBID:flat-information-layer+sub-layer-skip+information-layer-business-decision+information-layer-self-grant+implicit-view+role-name-only-authorization+level-inheritance+scope-expansion+field-wildcard-for-sensitive-data+frontend-filter-as-security+post-response-redaction+raw-secret-return+credential/token/log-secret-view+cross-owner-read-without-grant+expired/revoked-grant-use+subscription-without-per-event-check+cache-after-revoke+error/count/timing-side-channel+bulk-export-by-default+permission-sovereign-content-ownership+星澄-V5-or-secret-view+VC-through-general-view-level+direct-destination-response+information-layer-bypass\n星澄 bypasses permission review only for V4 global read-only review and its separately governed VC access; it never bypasse