INSERT INTO "codex_search_document" ("provision_type", "provision_id", "module_code", "law_code", "subject", "content", "content_hash", "lifecycle_state", "version_identity") VALUES (E'article', E'D28', E'CODEX_MODULE_AUTHORITY', E'CODEX_MAIN', E'hot-update-hot-reload-release-certification', E'hot-update-hot-reload-release-certification\nUPDATE-BOUNDARY:automatic update applies only to an already registered dependency identity and source; NEW-DEPENDENCY:any new direct/transitive package,runtime,SDK,toolchain,provider/source or capability dependency requires explicit permission artifact before download/install/lock/execute;DOWNLOADS:package downloads use exactly Visual Studio Installer or Winget and language package managers never perform a network download. VERSION-TIMING:normal latest waits 14 complete days from verified upstream published_at; verified major/critical security,major compatibility failure,withdrawal or EOL may waive waiting only. ACTIVATION:immutable staging>identity/provenance/license/security/API-ABI/contract/build/test/resource/rollback>canary>waves>atomic switch>stability. RETIREMENT:prior version SUPERSEDED>ROLLBACK_ONLY>RETENTION_EXPIRED>PURGE_READY>PURGED; after stable successor+zero consumers/references+completed migration+rollback window+purge evidence,automatically remove binaries,packages,caches,old environment and rebuildable artifacts; UPDATE-DETECTION:every-24-hours+immediate-governed-security-advisory-event; RETIREMENT-TAG:mandatory from SUPERSEDED through PURGE_READY and binds dependency-id+old-version+successor-version+state+reason+zero-consumer-progress+rollback-deadline+scheduled-purge-at\n\nPACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER:每24小時偵測一次。未具明確新增套件許可者自動標記DEFERRED_AWAITING_PERMISSION；一般新版發布未滿14日者自動標記DEFERRED_OBSERVATION_WINDOW。遞延不等於拒絕、通過或已安裝，遞延期間禁止下載、安裝、鎖定或執行；條件成熟後於下一次週期自動重新評估。重大安全或相容性事件得立即加跑受管檢查。\nFORBID:new-dependency-without-explicit-permission+transitive-dependency-smuggling+new-source-without-permission+floating-latest+runtime-self-update+normal-update-before-14-days+emergency-gate-bypass+more-than-one-valid-rollback-version+old-version-retained-after-PURGE_READY+delete-before-zero-reference/rollback-expiry+missing-or-stale-retirement-tag+update-detection-interval-not-24-hours\nAlready-loaded unchanged governed backend module may reexecute under B14 only after current release certificate and artifact digest are reverified; no new version identity is created', E'ad2d0e40474c92777cf0ef0aef57fa4ba8449d9a1d10327c0ad90627b2d7c50b', E'active', E'2026-10-01T16:43:07Z');
