activation-ledger records-from/to/reason/decision-proof/certificate/time; VERIFICATION:post-repair/restart/reload release-id+all-roots+runtime-generation+frontend-backend-match+stability-window; USER-NOTICE:active-version+operation+preserved-or-rollback-status\n\nPACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER:每24小時偵測一次。未具明確新增套件許可者自動標記DEFERRED_AWAITING_PERMISSION；一般新版發布未滿14日者自動標記DEFERRED_OBSERVATION_WINDOW。遞延不等於拒絕、通過或已安裝，遞延期間禁止下載、安裝、鎖定或執行；條件成熟後於下一次週期自動重新評估。重大安全或相容性事件得立即加跑受管檢查。\nFORBID:auto-repair-reset+watchdog-reset+startup-reset+hot-reload-reset+frontend-refresh-reset+backend-restart-reset+workspace-sync-reset+installer-default-restore+Git-checkout-as-runtime-baseline+cache-as-authority+copy-old-artifact-over-new+silent-version-downgrade+implicit-rollback+rollback-without-new-certificate+partial-pointer-update+pointer-derived-from-mtime+repair-changing-release-id+delete-active-certificate+declare-ready-on-frontend-backend-release-mismatch+erase-activation-history\nWhen the active certified release is itself unverifiable, affected execution fails closed; recovery may activate a prior certified release only through the explicit certified rollback flow', E'6fc0cf252702320ae62e420459b163341c41944a612351372d556c07582198c2', E'active', E'2026-10-01T16:43:07Z');
