son+latency+error-rate+queue-depth+resource-headroom+dependency-state+checkpoint-age+generation+release-id; FAILURE-BUDGET-EXHAUSTED:affected-capability-fail-closed+quarantine+user-notification+learning-evidence; STABLE:all-required-signals-current+no-unbounded-growth+error/latency/restart thresholds satisfied throughout stability-window\n\nPACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER:每24小時偵測一次。未具明確新增套件許可者自動標記DEFERRED_AWAITING_PERMISSION；一般新版發布未滿14日者自動標記DEFERRED_OBSERVATION_WINDOW。遞延不等於拒絕、通過或已安裝，遞延期間禁止下載、安裝、鎖定或執行；條件成熟後於下一次週期自動重新評估。重大安全或相容性事件得立即加跑受管檢查。\nFORBID:shared-failure-domain-for-independent-tools+main-system-crash-terminating-independent-tool+unbounded-process/thread/task/queue/memory/disk/connection-growth+restart-loop+fixed-immediate-restart+multiple-supervisors+stale-generation-result+partial-state-as-complete+silent-data-loss+dependency-failure-cascade+traffic-before-ready+force-stop-without-bounded-drain-or-checkpoint+health-or-stability-claim-from-process-existence-alone+hidden-degraded-state+repair-without-sovereign-chain+uncertified-runtime-content+automatic-reset-of-certified-hot-update+information-layer-bypass\nEmergency termination may skip draining only when continued execution threatens integrity or security; evidence preservation and post-stop verification remain mandatory');
INSERT INTO "codex_search_fts" ("provision_type", "provision_id", "module_code", "law_code", "subject", "content") VALUES (E'article', E'B24', E'CODEX_MODULE_ORDINANCE', E'CODEX_SUBORDINATE_ORDINANCES', E'reciprocal-main-system-independent-tool-runtime-isolation', E'reciprocal-main-system-independent-tool-runtime-isolation\nISOLATION-SET:{main-system}+{each-independent-tool-as-separate-individual}; RECIPROCITY:rules-apply-equally-in-every-direction; EACH-INDIVIDUAL-OWNS:process-tree+OS-lifecycle-boundary+runtime-generation+supervisor+watchdog+frontend+backend+threads+tasks+queues+connections+resource-budget+state+data+logs+cache+temporary-files+release+certificate+health+repair+update+shutdown; PROCESS-LIFETIME:no-individual-is-child-lifetime-dependent-on-another+no-shared-kill-job+no-parent-death-signal+no-global-process-name-control; RUNTIME-INDEPENDENCE:after-authorized-launch each-tool-operates-without-main-system-presence+main-system-operates-without-any-tool-presence; RUNNING-STATE:one-individual-running/stopped/starting/stopping/degraded/failed/recovering does-not-change-another-individual-state; FAILURE-ISOLATION:crash+hang+deadlock+exception+memory-leak+CPU/GPU/disk exhaustion+port-conflict+connection-loss+data-corruption+invalid-update+repair-failure contained-to-owner; CONTROL:main-system-may-submit-targeted-request-through-information-layer but-cannot-be-tool-supervisor/runtime-owner; TOOL-cannot-control-main-system-or-other-tool; INFORMATION-LAYER-LOSS:only-cross-individual-communication/status/control becomes-unavailable+each-current-runtime-continues-under-own-local-safe-policy+state-changing-cross-individual-requests-fail-closed; SHARED-INFRASTRUCTURE:tenant/route/session/pool/quota/circuit-breaker/failure-budget isolated-per-individual+shared-adapter-failure-must-not-terminate-consumers; RESOURCE:per-individual quotas+no-unbounded-borrow+resource-pressure-load-shed-owner-first+critical-main-reservation-does-not-seize-tool-owned-state; START/STOP:tar